fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"rtsp/rtspsrc.html#rtspsrc::remove-key","fragment":"\n\tremove-key\n\nRemoves the key for a specific stream.\nWhen the 'client-managed-mikey' mode is enabled, this can be used\nafter informing the server of the new crypto params (see signal\n'set-mikey-parameter') to remove previous keys and force srtpdec\nto request new keys.\nParameters:\na rtspsrc\nthe id of the stream for which to remove the key.\nTRUE when the command could be issued, FALSE otherwise\n\n\tFlags:\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRun Last\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tAction\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});